    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9601" root="حول" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوِيلٌ</span></b> : see 4, in the latter half of the paragraph. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] One who is <i>responsible,</i> or
<i>answerable.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>A witness.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِوَلٌ</span>: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِيلَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also [<i>Desire:</i>
or <i>a seeking:</i> or <i>a seeking by an artful contrivance</i> or <i>device,</i> or <i>by artful</i> or <i>skilful management, to find a way of attaining an object:</i>] a
subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاوَلَهُ</span>. (S, O, K.)

